\f1\b \cf2 \strokec2 Market Relevance:
\f0\b0 \
The \cf2 \strokec2 Smith Predictor\cf2 \strokec2  is a practical and widely used solution in industrial applications like \cf2 \strokec2 long-distance process control\cf2 \strokec2  (e.g., pumping stations), \cf2 \strokec2 high-precision motion control\cf2 \strokec2 , and \cf2 \strokec2 remote-controlled robotics\cf2 \strokec2  where latency significantly degrades performance. The ability to model and control different motor types is foundational for engineers working with \cf2 \strokec2 industrial automation and electric vehicles\cf2 \strokec2 .
